/*
Kythera and Melos (ids 320-347), from design/phase4/SCRIPT.md Part 3, in its
order. Species are Aethos names (constants/ichor_species_stubs_act3.h).
Where the build differs from the script:
  - Pic: Titanborn M / F is the Titanborn portrait, Titan Grunt (as in the slice
    and Phase 2), until the art batch draws the pair.
  - Pic: Pilgrim M is Pilgrim, world-act1's portrait.
  - Music: SCRIPT's Swimmer, Girl and Rich jingles are still Emerald's (SCRIPT
    Part 9), so those trainers use the Ichor Male or Female jingle, by gender,
    until the music batch repoints them: Eudoros, Kerdon, Kymaios, Antalkidas,
    Hagne, Pontinos, Philotes, Kolymbos, Anthousa, Rhodanthe, Thestylis,
    Bathyllos, Euthykles and Myrsine.
  - Abilities the vanilla stand-in can't have are left out, because the game
    stops on an "illegal ability" screen when the battle starts (trainer_util.c's
    SetCorrectAbilityNum). Put them back when the dex lands:
      Kerdon's Midonos       Ability: Good as Gold
      Philotes's Himerow     Ability: Cute Charm
      Galatea's Himerow      Ability: Cute Charm
      Galatea's Chelyra      Ability: Punk Rock
      Galatea's Aphrogene    Ability: Marvel Scale
      Galatea's Korantha     Ability: Natural Cure
      Galatea's Kalliglyph   Ability: Solid Rock
    tools/ichor/tests/act3_trainers.sh fails once a species can take its
    ability and the line is still missing.
*/

